    "created_at": "2016-04-01T12:43:45Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-04-01T12:43:45Z",
    "body": "I realized there's also a subtle but important difference between a document's relevant settings object and a document's associated Window object. The latter changes during `document.open()` while the former (probably) doesn't. So with that it seems most of this patch is wrong.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
